sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant F as Frontend
    participant B as Backend
    participant D as PostgreSQL
    participant W as Fresh Analysis Workflow
    alt Assistant requested clarification
        U->>F: Answer clarification
        F->>B: POST message action=clarification_answer
        B->>D: Persist authoritative user evidence
        B->>W: Start fresh analysis
    else User adds case information
        U->>F: Add information
        F->>B: POST message action=add_information
        B->>D: Persist authoritative user evidence
        B->>W: Start fresh analysis
    end
    W->>D: Load initial plus all qualifying evidence
    W->>W: Recompute evidence SHA-256
    Note over W: RAG and Main Analysis run again
    W->>D: Persist new context and analysis
    B-->>F: Updated state

